{
  "id": "venice",
  "name": "Venice",
  "region": "Italy",
  "about": "The historic centre of Venice, from the station and Piazzale Roma to Sant'Elena, with the Giudecca and San Giorgio Maggiore across the water and San Michele to the north. The land and the canals both come from OpenStreetMap (cityLand): its islands less its canals, paved, its buildings as voxels under pitched terracotta roofs. Same scale as New York (6 units a metre) so the paramotors keep their size. Lagoon floor: uv run 3d/dem-to-glb.py src/locations/venice.json assets/locations/venice.glb; city: uv run 3d/city-to-glb.py src/locations/venice.json assets/locations/venice-city.glb",
